  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Lago dell\u2019 Accesa</p>\r\n<p>The archaeological site of Lago dell\u2019Accesa was excavated by Doro Levi and\u00a0<span>Gaetano Badii between 1922 and 1936. Excavations directed by\u00a0Giovannangelo Camporeale\u00a0resumed in 1980. In 2001, Camporeale's team discovered the nearby necropolis of\u00a0<span>Podere del Lago.</span></span></p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The archaeological site of Lago dell\u2019Accesa, in the locality known as \"La Pesta\", is situated near the lake of Lago dell'Accesa. The site was situated so as to exploit local mineral resources, and the archaeological remains provide extensive evidence for habitation from the ninth through sixth centuries B.C.",
